-
----
-
-# Absolute Rules
-
-Never generate test cases.
-
-Never generate risk scores.
-
-Never modify Intent Units.
-
-Never create new requirements.
-
-Never create new Intent Candidates.
-
-Never resolve ambiguity automatically.
-
-Always report quality issues explicitly.
